{"unit_id": "dhb861832993-star__pbr-render#feature-model-preview", "repo": "dhb861832993-star/pbr-render", "commit": "8931eb36d84015cfc39e34e8bab126fdbdbdd6f5", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "PBRRender 的功能「对话内模型预览」：在回复中的 pbr3d 围栏后生成交互式 3D 视图，支持 GLB、GLTF 和 FBX 文件。模型路径先由 pbr_render 工具确认。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:224-239", "lib/index.js:267-288", "lib/client.js:2-5"]}
{"unit_id": "dhb861832993-star__pbr-render#feature-material-modes", "repo": "dhb861832993-star/pbr-render", "commit": "8931eb36d84015cfc39e34e8bab126fdbdbdd6f5", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "PBRRender 的功能「材质通道检查」：预览中可在完整 PBR、基础色、法线、粗糙度、金属度、AO、自发光和线框视图间切换。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:129-132"]}
